# Underrealm Lich: the cards put into the graveyard together go there in the order their owner chooses (CR 404.3), not the
# order they were looked at. Bot1's turn 3 draw is replaced by a look at Ornithopter, Llanowar Elves and a Forest; it takes
# the Forest, and as the other two arrive in the graveyard together (Shallow Grave in the game reads its order) it is asked
# their order and puts the Ornithopter on top of the Elves. Shallow Grave then returns the top creature card of the
# graveyard: the Ornithopter (exiled again at the end step), not the Elves, which stay.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Underrealm Lich
Shallow Grave
Mox Pearl
Ornithopter
Llanowar Elves
Forest
Island x20

